    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch10-13: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.86";
    dc:description "The specified models and deterministic generators make a direct, inexpensive replication possible. The unrestricted prevalence statement remains conditional on choices of rules, fitting criteria, and feature metrics.";
